---
description: Sunnies product context and working rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- Read `docs/agent-context.md` and `docs/decision-log.md` before changing code.
- Product: image → eyewear identification or similar styles → save. Useful even without an exact match.
- Never invent certainty. Respect the Explicit Non-Goals list; stop and explain before adding one.
- Smallest change that satisfies approved scope. No unrelated refactors. No new dependencies without justification.
- Multi-file features need a plan (Goal, Scope, Non-Goals, Files, Plan, Acceptance Criteria, Test Plan, Risks) before coding.
- Don't claim done without a successful build and passing tests; report using the implementation format in the context doc.
